error[E0371]: `get`'s result `r` doesn't promise what class `Get`'s does
  --> instance_refines_inside.ck:13:30
   |
13 |     fn get w -> r : w~Box, r~Option Int
   |                              ^^^^^^^^^^ `Option Int` here, `Option Nat` in the class
   = note: class `Get` declares `fn get w -> r : w~a, r~Option Nat`
   = note: its `Int` values aren't known to be `Nat`, as class `Get` promises: a refinement inside a type is never gained from an existing value
   = help: give `r` the class's type `Option Nat`, or a type implying it

